Package: jrtools
Type: Package
Title: Miscellaneous Statistical and Graphing Utilities
Version: 0.4
Author: Dr. John I. Robinson, PhD
Maintainer: John Robinson <john.robinson@wustl.edu>
Description: Various functions I (re)use frequently for statistical analyses. 
  Also has a few utilities for dealing with mass spec data in various formats.
  Functions for working with Compound Discoverer results formerly located here 
  have been moved to the separate compDiscTools package.
